   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo \u00b7 Remove Background\nLoad a photo into **image_1** and queue. The model outputs a native **RGBA PNG** (transparent background) at the input's own size (`resolution 0`).\n\n- Want the subject extracted differently? Edit the instruction, e.g. `Extract the person in <image1> and remove everything else, output a PNG image`.\n- Keep **Save \u2192 format png** to preserve the alpha channel.\n- Model switch (yellow, left): false = `Turbo Q8_0 GGUF`, true = `Turbo FP8`.\n- **Speed:** the Instruction node (AIHub) reads the prompt and references once; turn `encode_negative` on only if you raise cfg above 1. The VAE runs in bf16. For a quicker, smaller result use resolution **768** (the AIHub *fast* preset).\n\n**Sampling (Turbo):** the checkpoint's own 8-step schedule in *Turbo schedule* (ManualSigmas), euler, cfg **1**. Changing the steps means editing that list; Qwen hasn't evaluated other schedules. The negative prompt is ignored at cfg 1."
   ],
   "title": "Notes"
  }
